======================node taints=============

kubectl taint nodes node1 app=blue:NoSchedule

tolerations need to be added to pods:

spec:
 tolerations"
  - key:"app"
    operator:"equal"
    value:"blue"
    effect:"NoSchedule"

conclusion: accept the pods which have certain tolerations

kubectl describe node node01 | grep -i taints

kubectl describe node controlplane

kubectl taint nodes controlplane node-role.kubernetes.io/control-plane:NoSchedule-
end the end the minus sign is to remove taint

